flowchart TD
    Failure[Downstream email failure] --> Count[Increment attempt and circuit failure count]
    Count --> Threshold{Three consecutive failures?}
    Threshold -- No --> Backoff[Exponential backoff]
    Threshold -- Yes --> Open[Circuit Guardian open]
    Open --> Durable[Leave job durable in database]
    Durable --> Cooldown[Cooldown expires]
    Cooldown --> Probe[Next send attempt]
    Backoff --> Attempt[Worker retry or self-heal sweep]
    Attempt --> Success{Send succeeds?}
    Success -- Yes --> Sent[Mark sent and close circuit]
    Success -- No --> Count
    Attempt --> Limit{Five attempts?}
    Limit -- Yes --> DLQ[Mark dead_letter]
